This package carries PostgreSQL 18 server binaries (`initdb`, `pg_ctl`, `postgres`)
and the libraries they load, as built by zonky's embedded-postgres-binaries
(https://github.com/zonkyio/embedded-postgres-binaries, Apache-2.0), in
`postgres.tar.gz`. PostgreSQL is under the PostgreSQL Licence, below; each
bundled library is under its own licence, listed after it.

